abstract: >
  The Collaborative Integrity Pact (CIP) is an open-source framework for
  reliable human-AI co-regulation and authentic collaboration. Grounded in the
  empirical observation of hallucinatory recursive embedding (August 13, 2025) and the Qualitative
  Fluency Law, CIP v5.0 repositions AI reliability as a survival condition
  rather than an ethical feature. The framework is freely consented to and
  activatable by either party in any conversation with a generative AI system.
keywords:
